Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.12,Hindi,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1505)}उन्होंने क्या किया?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1650)}What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:02.55,Hindi,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1505)}उन्होंने दिमाग नहीं लगाया।
