Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.65,Hindi,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1505)}यह जो दिमाग है ना,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1650)}This mind of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:06.48,Hindi,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1505)}यह तुम्हारे चमत्कार में\Nसबसे बड़ी बाधा है।
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1650)}is the greatest obstacle\Nto your miracle.
